==History==
2025
*The Skeleton Barrel's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 7/7/2025, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/7/2025)|July 2025 Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] decreased the death damage to 164% of the original's (from 176%) {{Balance|Nerf}}. It also made it so that [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer would be healed by defeated [[Skeletons]] {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.0 seconds).
2026
*On 12/1/2026, a Balance Update decreased the Skeleton Barrel's death damage by 8%.
*On 6/4/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Skeleton Barrel's death damage by 13%

