==Trivia==
*The word "''Skeleton''" comes from the Greek "''σκελετός''" (''skeletós''), meaning dried up or withered.
*The Skeleton Barrel is 1 of 6 evolved [[cards]] associated with [[Skeletons]], with the others being [[Bomber/Evolution|Bomber]], [[Witch/Evolution|Witch]], [[Wall Breakers/Evolution|Wall Breakers]], [[Skeleton Army/Evolution|Skeleton Army]], and of course, [[Skeletons/Evolution|Skeletons]].
*The Skeleton Barrel is 1 of 4 evolved [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] to die as a part of their attack, the others being the [[Ice Spirit/Evolution|Ice Spirit]], Wall Breakers, and Runners.
*The barrel of the Evolved Skeleton Barrel looks similar to the hull of the [[Rocket]].
